    "created_at": "2026-05-06T06:46:02.271847+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/28DB9FE7-A974-44B5-82BD-EA3E0D8E58A8.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "066ab3cc-a397-473c-b793-757af4201c6c",
    "text": "Evet, bugün yoğun bir gün. İyi günler.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2160,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "56.8 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-08T16:53:53.354241+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/5E00D560-4F11-4FC3-B323-706EFB3B70CC.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "2b64387c-9127-467f-9ab0-1fc9c15199dc",
    "text": "İngilizce öğretmeniyim, çoğunlukla yetişkinlere.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2640,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "55.0 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-08T16:54:12.023246+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/A54B7011-668A-4EE5-9DE2-0ACAD65BE9CE.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "6fc59427-8e3b-4333-8076-780f3b6271bf",
    "text": "Bir cappuccino ve bir dilim havuçlu kek alabilir miyim?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "eve",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 3120,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "56.7 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-08T16:54:21.081779+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/E2EA7DB0-0E3E-4A4B-9151-0B29261377EC.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "5e788612-ae46-4da1-a29e-98402e7fe868",
    "text": "Şarap listenize bakabilir miyim? Kadeheyle satıyorsunuz değil mi?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 3816,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "58.7 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-08T16:54:28.737578+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/17162581-2D99-444B-A273-76B5D8274B93.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "dcaf0891-d525-4213-823f-2d2ee7566a87",
    "text": "Ben de köfte alayım. Yanına da beyaz peynirli salata olsun.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "eve",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 3504,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.4 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-08T16:54:41.396718+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/05E6A989-886D-4FF2-BF3A-554BDE5D7A13.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "afe8bd59-b727-482a-a463-41302bb43cca",
    "text": "Baş ağrısı için parasetamol alabilirsiniz, boğaz için de bu pastiller işe yarar.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 4824,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.3 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-08T16:55:19.457313+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/90D8F3DA-8DBA-4942-8CBB-E9B6FD810B88.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "cbcca865-7e77-4630-95dd-fe3b8694aa6f",
    "text": "Hayır, aksine yemekle ya da yemekten sonra almanız daha iyi olur.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 3960,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.9 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-08T16:55:26.865807+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/6C4FB7E7-1009-4565-9AB9-17BB380A2B0E.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "4aa75b2d-3b82-42d2-9c45-8f8c83defbbf",
    "text": "Sanat Müzesi'nin yanına bıraksanız iyi olur.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2616,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.5 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-08T16:55:40.986764+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/6E6FA0AA-E44E-4C92-928B-E249E0D678E4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "f6a5eb08-b512-416f-a54a-31504467a7f8",
    "text": "Kartla ödeyebilir miyim?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 1464,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.0 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-08T16:55:46.364912+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/A60E356A-9B8C-4DA1-BD4B-39A069FCF6D6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "b6515f69-0e2e-4aa4-98a3-e85dccdf59db",
    "text": "Çok iyiyim, teşekkür ederim. İşe mi gidiyorsunuz?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2760,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "56.3 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:08:20.344431+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/F5D106FB-6D57-4F7A-A15F-1754330672CF.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "7577f093-8873-40dc-b929-9856905fd2b6",
    "text": "Hayır, özür dilerim, yarın meşgulüm. Ama cumartesi konuşalım. O zaman görüşürüz.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 4824,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.3 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:08:27.768967+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/C3A160C0-8991-4221-A606-C3E28CC8FA3F.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "4ed8317f-d2a9-4ea7-82e9-94a00fc6601d",
    "text": "Ben Fransa'dan geliyorum. Burada iki yıldır yaşıyorum.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 3264,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.4 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:08:31.921706+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/F95A3A13-CACC-4BD4-A7B8-B7283831C02C.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "1afb0985-d378-43ea-95b0-999ab949cdce",
    "text": "Manchester'dan geliyorum, ama şu an Londra'da yaşıyorum. Ya siz?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 3816,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.6 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:08:34.599993+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/8E889FEF-6A33-474E-B981-FB0D883E9C7A.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "1ea49ffe-87e9-4cad-8da0-a20f981ddde0",
    "text": "Hemen hazırlıyorum. Başka bir şey ister misiniz?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2880,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.0 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:08:43.378868+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/0BC94FC3-3349-4BBA-B7D2-F07120C53597.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "db96db12-0f00-4371-8692-fa37fd18b88e",
    "text": "Toplam dört yüz yirmi lira.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 1536,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "56.9 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:08:43.639317+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/839EB3FD-5BCE-4D49-85CF-9C1CCFDFE9F1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "50fb5cc3-4487-42a6-ba7e-a443245ad51e",
    "text": "Bu akşam yemek yiyecek misiniz?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 1800,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "58.1 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:08:52.908396+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/BCA5269E-2760-4AB3-8F1A-6C0F0A164F5E.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "c294a599-4da0-49a1-8e98-843a1baaae3d",
    "text": "Büyük bir kadeh beyaz şarap istiyorum, lütfen.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "182a91893636",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2688,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "58.4 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:08:53.044479+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/01D8B569-5766-48B5-956A-DED6E6FA84EA.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "440fbc14-3bba-479b-a10c-1ae33d7d2c89",
    "text": "Küçük bir kadeh kırmızı şarap alabilir miyim?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2664,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.2 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:08:54.148446+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/29B87C29-609E-40EF-B49C-B8E326BB428B.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "bab6a318-44f5-4562-80cd-32fb2a1b6a79",
    "text": "Çok naziksiniz! Evet, tatildeyim ve daha iyi Türkçe konuşmak için daha fazla pratik yapmam gerekiyor. Çok teşekkürler, hoşça kalın.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 7920,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.5 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:09:12.461865+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/081EFF63-5A1A-41D5-859F-BC995FCC6B43.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "14c78c08-e688-4b92-88e0-395c68ab47a4",
    "text": "Hoş geldiniz. Evet, üç gecelik çift kişilik bir odanız var. Kimliğinizi görebilir miyim, lütfen?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 5784,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.3 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:09:18.32689+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/C0524F5E-2623-4DB5-B93D-D0D38DC1A1F8.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "aaa10739-38c9-4af5-9331-7b00d64985a8",
    "text": "Baş ağrısı için parasetamol deneyin, boğaz için de bu pastilleri.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 3984,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.3 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:09:27.990702+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/2132F0F1-B77C-4B60-9CE7-441E048627C6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "c5ee6dc4-665d-4603-ad1b-8ad7a9c16baa",
    "text": "Parasetamolü ne sıklıkla kullanmalıyım?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2400,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.5 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:09:29.83784+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/C4ED546B-A67E-4D9D-AF71-BF1199AC844B.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "272ed23d-76ae-4dea-ac5a-aa752ae7f7c2",
    "text": "Evet, sizi bilet gişesinin tam yanına bırakacağım.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2832,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "56.6 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:09:38.602242+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/B308B13E-3AF7-45F9-A6F4-C175B581BBBA.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "6418db12-313a-4ee5-a873-1372c4525277",
    "text": "İstasyonda bilet nerede alabileceğimi biliyor musunuz?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 3264,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.4 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:09:38.633583+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/9280E49A-574E-4401-A657-65A556F44B6C.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "68c6aa26-14d3-4016-8fd3-0c10c786ec0b",
    "text": "Sizinle Türkçe konuşmayı pratik yapmayı denesem olur mu? Çok uzun zamandır öğrenmiyorum ve başkalarıyla konuşmak hâlâ beni biraz gergin hissettiriyor.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 9192,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.3 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:09:42.78974+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/0409169B-9107-405F-B090-E19D854D2589.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "eca8ae5e-8699-4cec-b520-0e99ffcb6953",
    "text": "Çok iyi ilerlediğini düşünüyorum. Etkilendim. Türkçe konuşan herkesle Türkçe konuşmaya hazır olduğunu düşünüyorum.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 6384,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "56.0 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:09:46.495726+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/6A3E6CC1-EF74-4021-9414-657D38D15E13.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "52053814-5ad9-42d8-8abf-f6cf2aabac34",
    "text": "Şu an sana yeterince yavaş konuşuyor muyum?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2568,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.7 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:09:50.068361+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/21CE77F0-E438-47C0-9472-E2F616D5864D.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "a5583ebf-a460-4e63-a25a-d2e51bb5df98",
    "text": "Kendimi doğru şekilde ifade etmek için yeterince hızlı düşünemediğimde bu biraz sinir bozucu oluyor. Ama daha güvenle konuşmak istiyorsam pratik yapmaya devam etmem gerektiğini biliyorum.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 11064,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.2 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:09:51.559092+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/F9EDA1E9-0C40-4DDB-BC8D-554F4491A343.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "62939f8e-6935-4b58-ba70-9cdf8bfd3a37",
    "text": "Evet, teşekkür ederim. Sadece tek bir kişiyle konuşmak daha kolay. Ama ne söyleyeceğimi düşünmek biraz zor. Ne söyleyeceğimden tam emin değilim, ama konuşmaya başlamak için yeterince konuşabildiğimi hissediyorum.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 12960,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.1 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:09:52.599135+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/FE6486A2-BEAB-478C-992A-F694F5E3BFFF.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "ff6676d9-d020-412d-a755-206aa5a3030e",
    "text": "Zaten kendinden emin olman gerekiyor. Farkında olduğundan çok daha iyi ilerlediğini düşünüyorum. Seninle konuşmak beni rahat hissettiriyor ve çok da yavaş konuşmuyorum.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 10104,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.1 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:09:53.350152+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/388A20FF-D987-4598-B947-3795F55F1DAF.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "bace2183-4653-423f-bd98-ab8beeefcfe9",
    "text": "Tam olarak ihtiyacım olan bu tür bir pratik. Konuşurken beynimin değiştiğini hissedebiliyorum sanki! Yardımın için gerçekten minnettarım. Ama iyi konuşamadığım bir dilde konuştuğumda ne kadar yorulduğum şaşırtıcı.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 12696,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.6 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-10T22:09:59.962347+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/156A0F8A-7A2B-4BFE-87BC-36D8BBA0DAA5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "f82509c9-21d4-4a13-8d19-9211e6a28f16",
    "text": "Çok iyiyim, teşekkür ederim.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 1560,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "55.7 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:49:08.812145+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/F82509C9-21D4-4A13-8D19-9211E6A28F16.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "e5dbec73-0e22-412d-9684-6569655ad619",
    "text": "O zaman görüşürüz.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 1104,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.3 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:49:22.32308+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/E5DBEC73-0E22-412D-9684-6569655AD619.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "48daf060-329d-45ed-9fa1-9aeddb8337b7",
    "text": "Evet, çok uzun.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "d634b6da3d3b",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 864,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "57.6 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:49:24.831367+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/48DAF060-329D-45ED-9FA1-9AEDDB8337B7.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "a3bfa0ca-6409-4e42-bf5a-68faf6127d98",
    "text": "Manchester'dan geliyorum, ama şu an Londra'da yaşıyorum.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 3000,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "53.6 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:49:34.759188+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/A3BFA0CA-6409-4E42-BF5A-68FAF6127D98.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "8457654e-c4df-4726-b0ac-d600a02cbcad",
    "text": "Burada iki yıldır yaşıyorum.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 1656,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.1 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:49:36.609195+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/8457654E-C4DF-4726-B0AC-D600A02CBCAD.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "c2b19a2f-2bfc-4aeb-86f0-100381a9408a",
    "text": "Ben hemşireyim, hemen köşe başındaki hastanede.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 1104,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "23.5 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:49:38.786431+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/C2B19A2F-2BFC-4AEB-86F0-100381A9408A.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "a5aa3a08-515f-444f-aa35-59cec5105d9f",
    "text": "İngilizce öğretiyorum, ama bir okulda değil.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 1368,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "31.1 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:49:42.726843+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/A5AA3A08-515F-444F-AA35-59CEC5105D9F.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "afceabba-46ae-45ce-a9ac-d53d1478401c",
    "text": "Burada eşim ve çocuklarımla tatildeyim.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 1872,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "48.0 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:49:43.913932+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/AFCEABBA-46AE-45CE-A9AC-D53D1478401C.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "f351e20d-093c-4644-b9fc-010a98b48814",
    "text": "İçeride oturmak ister misiniz?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 1824,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.8 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:49:56.610542+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/F351E20D-093C-4644-B9FC-010A98B48814.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "1eb83011-294b-48d5-94ae-b91aa24ddc68",
    "text": "Peynirli bir sandviç istiyorum, lütfen.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "eve",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2328,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.7 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:50:09.89955+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/1EB83011-294B-48D5-94AE-B91AA24DDC68.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "b6e2c177-3488-44db-b4e1-a43a2b1cee5c",
    "text": "Affedersiniz — glutensiz bir şeyiniz var mı?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 1368,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "31.1 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:50:17.329718+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/B6E2C177-3488-44DB-B4E1-A43A2B1CEE5C.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "2a5baed8-ca1f-4fa0-b60d-4774b04f9c60",
    "text": "Hazır olduğunuzda hesabı da alabilir miyiz?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "eve",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2520,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "58.6 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:50:30.02463+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/2A5BAED8-CA1F-4FA0-B60D-4774B04F9C60.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "0fa103ca-9f93-4a6d-a2c0-e33abe22826e",
    "text": "Çok minnettarım.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 672,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "42.0 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:50:37.413969+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/0FA103CA-9F93-4A6D-A2C0-E33ABE22826E.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "91b581a3-6917-455c-af79-06cdd02480c4",
    "text": "Çok iyi Türkçe konuşuyorsunuz.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "eve",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 1848,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.6 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:50:38.951687+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/91B581A3-6917-455C-AF79-06CDD02480C4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "f39c1191-8d05-4d3f-831e-0207dcc6c8ec",
    "text": "Evet, tatildeyim ve daha iyi Türkçe konuşmak için daha fazla pratik yapmam gerekiyor.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 4896,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "57.6 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:50:40.368372+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/F39C1191-8D05-4D3F-831E-0207DCC6C8EC.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "68fc6ecd-1704-473d-9213-b3cbb98d6d03",
    "text": "Çok teşekkürler, hoşça kalın.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 1776,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.2 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:50:40.921964+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/68FC6ECD-1704-473D-9213-B3CBB98D6D03.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "c22fe7d2-834c-4070-8aa1-848523958957",
    "text": "Evet, üç gecelik çift kişilik bir odanız var.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2712,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "60.3 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:50:47.193825+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/C22FE7D2-834C-4070-8AA1-848523958957.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "8efa1234-f9bd-487d-bce6-91d0bca6646a",
    "text": "Kimliğinizi görebilir miyim, lütfen?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2040,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "56.7 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:50:47.849832+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/8EFA1234-F9BD-487D-BCE6-91D0BCA6646A.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "400536d2-b1fe-4c44-a0c7-218a3226dc34",
    "text": "Pek iyi hissetmiyorum — bir şey önerebilir misiniz?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 3000,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "58.8 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:50:59.108257+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/400536D2-B1FE-4C44-A0C7-218A3226DC34.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "db060e2d-e906-41f0-826d-410cfeb18026",
    "text": "Beni tren istasyonuna götürebilir misiniz, lütfen?",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2856,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "57.1 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:51:12.646218+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/DB060E2D-E906-41F0-826D-410CFEB18026.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "8fb799b7-3d59-408b-9757-e714c84df17d",
    "text": "Daha fazla kelime öğrenmem gerekiyor ve dinlemeyi pratik etmem gerekiyor.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2256,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "30.9 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:51:25.375122+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/8FB799B7-3D59-408B-9757-E714C84DF17D.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "a09d720c-debf-4f30-8e4b-91311badf9a0",
    "text": "Sadece tek bir kişiyle konuşmak daha kolay.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2568,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "59.7 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:51:27.643511+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/A09D720C-DEBF-4F30-8E4B-91311BADF9A0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "abfab8b4-9af3-41dc-a8c7-a1a95bdd32bf",
    "text": "Ama ne söyleyeceğimi düşünmek biraz zor.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 2280,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "57.0 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:51:28.127296+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/ABFAB8B4-9AF3-41DC-A8C7-A1A95BDD32BF.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "1d335480-820a-442a-95c2-56573fdf65a8",
    "text": "Ne söyleyeceğimden tam emin değilim, ama konuşmaya başlamak için yeterince konuşabildiğimi hissediyorum.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 3840,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "36.9 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:51:29.459509+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/1D335480-820A-442A-95C2-56573FDF65A8.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "78895cb8-cf85-49cb-b910-791ca5e6eab9",
    "text": "Çok iyi ilerlediğini düşünüyorum.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 1632,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "49.5 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:51:30.410881+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/78895CB8-CF85-49CB-B910-791CA5E6EAB9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "2740e9a8-254b-4848-8fa9-4b52214114fc",
    "text": "Türkçe konuşan herkesle Türkçe konuşmaya hazır olduğunu düşünüyorum.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "670a0c3ac005",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 3600,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "52.9 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:51:31.899002+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/2740E9A8-254B-4848-8FA9-4B52214114FC.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "19834309-b193-4734-afee-7811cd63ef11",
    "text": "Kendimi doğru şekilde ifade etmek için yeterince hızlı düşünemediğimde bu biraz sinir bozucu oluyor.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 6144,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
    "detail": "61.4 ms/char, under 61.6 for target1",
    "created_at": "2026-06-16T09:51:33.135886+00:00",
    "s3_key": "mastered/19834309-B193-4734-AFEE-7811CD63EF11.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "46141972-d0d7-4980-8c96-c9ace07e7896",
    "text": "Ama daha güvenle konuşmak istiyorsam pratik yapmaya devam etmem gerektiğini biliyorum.",
    "role": "target1",
    "voice_id": "ara",
    "language": "tur",
    "duration_ms": 4968,
    "verdict": "suspect",
    "reason": "rate",
